        "original_id": "2e887507-1a29-589a-a832-1a719b741995",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: York, England, Brentwood, Essex, Northern Europe\n- Organizations: York Minster, The Cathedral and Metropolitical Church of Saint Peter in York, The Cathedral of St Mary and St Helen\n- People: John Farr Abbott\n- Topics: Cathedrals\n\nFacts:\n- York Minster, formally called The Cathedral and Metropolitical Church of Saint Peter in York, is the cathedral of York, England.\n- York Minster is one of the largest cathedrals of its kind in Northern Europe.\n- The Cathedral of St Mary and St Helen is the Roman Catholic cathedral in Brentwood, Essex.\n- John Farr Abbott died in York.\n- John Farr Abbott is buried in York Minster.",
